Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 5.4 32/57] ASoC: rsnd: Don't treat master SSI in multi SSI setup as parent
Date:   Thu, 30 Apr 2020 09:51:53 -0400
Message-Id: <20200430135218.20372-32-sashal@kernel.org>
